        <mxCell id="78961159f06e98e8-25" value="&lt;p&gt;When someone’s picking a martial art, one of the first things they might think about is: &lt;strong&gt;Do I want a ranking system (belts and levels), or do I just want to train without worrying about ranks?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Martial arts generally fall into &lt;strong&gt;two categories&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontColor=#000000;" parent="78961159f06e98e8-17" vertex="1">
